nc UE8.5 UC8.9 UC8.6 UC8.2 UC8.3 UB8.12 UB8.5 UB8.9  # line 357: MAME grounds the crowd circuit's spare gates and op-amps, outputs and all (7B's 2, 8, 10 and 12 are outputs); the sheet draws none of these pins
